{"title": "Rays of Fire (Mol)", "pageid": 56612, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Rays_of_Fire_(Mol)", "categories": ["Spells", "Level 4 Spells", "Evocation spells", "Ranged spell attacks", "Actions", "Sources of Fire damage"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">This article is about the version of the spell given by <a href=\"/wiki/Mol\" title=\"Mol\">Mol</a> as part of <a href=\"/wiki/Gather_Your_Allies\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Gather Your Allies\">Gather Your Allies</a>. For the version used by cambions, see <a href=\"/wiki/Rays_of_Fire\" title=\"Rays of Fire\">Rays of Fire</a>. For the version granted by Helldusk Gloves, see <a href=\"/wiki/Rays_of_Fire_(Cantrip)\" title=\"Rays of Fire (Cantrip)\">Rays of Fire (Cantrip)</a>.  </div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Rays_of_Fire.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Rays_of_Fire.webp/300px-Rays_of_Fire.webp, /w/images/5/5b/Rays_of_Fire.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Rays_of_Fire.webp/300px-Rays_of_Fire.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Rays_of_Fire.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Rays of Fire</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Spells\" title=\"Spells\">level 4 evocation spell</a>. It launches 5 rays of fire at targets within range. The rays can all target the same creature, or they can be dispersed to different targets.\n<p>This unique variant of the spell is given as a potential reward from <a href=\"/wiki/Gather_Your_Allies\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Gather Your Allies\">Gather Your Allies</a> by securing <a href=\"/wiki/Mol\" title=\"Mol\">Mol's</a> support.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\nHurl 5 rays of fire. Each ray deals <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">3d6</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">Fire</span></a> damage.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/42px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a></dd><dt>Damage: 15~90</dt><dd class=\"bg3wiki-damage-display\" style=\"margin-left:0px\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;width:fit-content\"><span